      "message": "hal_implementation_test expects all HAL interfaces to be served on Cuttlefish so we cant test/verify the interface with VTS tests and an implementation. \nThis is done by installing the aidl/default/ services (`android.hardware.tv.hdmi-service` and `android.hardware.tv.cec-service`) on Cuttlefish.\n\nIt looks like other TV HALs are installed on only the tv version of Cuttlefish, and they are exempted from hal_implementation_test (because that test is not TV specific). So you\u0027ll want something like https://googleplex-android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/device/google/cuttlefish/+/15166594",
